        <item>
            <title>0.1.7</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What’s new in 0.1.7</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed overview metrics not refreshing after the selected timeframe changes.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Included from 0.1.6</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Separated the persistent menu-bar host from the dashboard UI, so dashboard-owned data and windows can be released when the dashboard closes.</li>
                    <li>Moved Codex source watching into the persistent menu-bar host, keeping cost and quota-derived metrics current while the dashboard window is closed.</li>
                    <li>Refined activity-chart hover cards, scrolling affordances, and model-visibility controls.</li>
                    <li>Improved dashboard lifecycle handling and memory-focused behavior across the host and helper processes.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
