        <item>
            <title>0.1.5</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What’s new</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added a Maintenance action to rebuild the history index from saved sessions.</li>
                    <li>Preserved cached-input metrics in rebuilt model breakdowns.</li>
                    <li>Normalized subscription plan labels, including clearer handling for API and unknown plans.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
